{1}{Well, well...if'n it isn't me old friend.  A friendly face is what I be needin' to see, matey.  The days have been dark since last we sailed...}{Well, well...if'n it isn't me old friend.  A friendly face is what I be needin' to see, lassie.  The days have been dark since last we sailed...}{}{}{}{}
