{23}{Oh, I don't know if'n old Drake's a cheat.  He's just lucky...about the luckiest old sea-dog I ever did meet.  I can't be callin' a man a cheat just because the dice landed his way...}{Oh, I don't know if'n old Drake's a cheat.  He's just lucky...about the luckiest old sea-dog I ever did meet.  I can't be callin' a man a cheat just because the dice landed his way...}{}{}{}{}
{24}{Maybe I could help...and I may need to call on that favor...}{}{5}{}{33}{}
