{27}{I really wish I could help you, matey.  But I no longer have the Gypsy Shadow...I've been spendin' most of me time starin' at the bottom of this ale mug...!}{I really wish I could help you, lassie.  But I no longer have the Gypsy Shadow...I've been spendin' most of me time starin' at the bottom if an ale mug...}{}{}{}{}
{28}{What happened, Captain?}{}{5}{}{9}{}
