{53}{Take ye to Thanatos?  matey, ye win me the Gypsy Shadow, and I'll take ye wherever ye be wantin' to go.  There's nothin' I wouldn't do to get behind her wheel once again...}{Take ye to Thanatos?  Lassie, ye win me the Gypsy Shadow, and I'll take ye wherever ye be wantin' to go.  There's nothin' I wouldn't do to get behind her wheel once again...}{}{}{}{}
