{59}{Well, I'm a little leery of even mentionin' it...its not somethin' I even like to think about, much less let spill outta me blowhole.  But ye seem ta need some help, and I owe ye one...}{Well, I'm a little leery of even mentionin' it...its not somethin' I even like to think about, much less let spill outta me blowhole.  But ye seem ta need some help, and I owe ye one...}{}{}{}{}
