{176}{I hope you find a way to get that ship, matey.  And if you happen to win back the Gypsy Shadow, I'll meet you on her decks...!}{I hope you find a way to get that ship, lassie.  And if you happen to win back the Gypsy Shadow, I'll meet you on her decks...!}{}{}{}{}
